[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0829","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0829.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0566","title":"IBM AIX syslog 文件写入拒绝服务漏洞","description":"攻击者可以从任意位置向 syslog 文件写入数据，通过填满日志磁盘空间导致拒绝服务，同时可掩盖攻击行为。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 系统，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0566"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-08-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"限制 syslog 文件的写入权限，配置日志轮转策略，部署入侵检测系统监控异常日志写入行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0566"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0829.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0498","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0301","title":"SunOS/Solaris ps 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SunOS 和 Solaris 系统中的 ps 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 ps 命令传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 SunOS 5.3/5.4/5.5/5.5.1 及 Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1 等多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0301"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1997-08-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级到不受影响的 SunOS/Solaris 版本，或安装 Sun 安全公告 149 号提供的补丁程序。限制本地用户对 ps 命令的访问权限可缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T12:06:30Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/149"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1470","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1308","title":"HP HP-UX 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 系统中某些程序未能正确处理超过 60000 的大用户 ID（UID）或组 ID（GID），存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建特制的大 UID/GID 账户，利用该缺陷绕过权限检查机制，从而获取更高系统权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20 版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1308"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-07-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:09Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 系统至 11.0 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，请安装 HP 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁（如 PHKL_19036 等补丁包），并在 /etc/default/security 中限制 UID/GID 最大值为 60000 以内，同时审查拥有超大 UID 的本地用户账户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-09.shtml","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-91.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7594.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1308.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1308","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1308.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1308.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6h2j-2p74-3pmh/GHSA-6h2j-2p74-3pmh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87891/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1308.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000197.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5614f315-b32d-4cfc-a30a-254d324597b4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1505","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1419","title":"Sun Solaris NIS+ 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.3 和 2.4 系统中的 NIS+ 服务的 nss_nisplus.so.1 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该库函数传入特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3 及 2.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，需本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1419"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-07-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun Security Bulletin #148 中提供的 NIS+ 补丁程序。由于 Solaris 2.3 和 2.4 已停止技术支持，建议升级到受支持的 Solaris 版本（如 Solaris 10 或 11）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任用户访问系统，并监控 /var/adm/messages 中的异常崩溃日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/148","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7535.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1419.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1419","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1419.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1419.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rc67-55r7-m84c/GHSA-rc67-55r7-m84c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1419.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--38886c33-6a1e-4e55-955a-82a6284d18be.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--38886c33-6a1e-4e55-955a-82a6284d18be.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1407","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1217","title":"Microsoft Windows NT PATH 环境变量本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 操作系统存在路径劫持漏洞，由于系统环境变量 PATH 中包含了当前工作目录（.），本地攻击者可在特定目录中放置与常用系统程序同名的特洛伊木马程序，诱使系统或管理员执行该恶意程序，从而提升权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 系列版本，需本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1217"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"从 PATH 环境变量中移除当前工作目录 (.)，可通过系统属性 → 高级 → 环境变量编辑 PATH 值，删除末尾的 %SystemRoot%\\system32;%SystemRoot%; 之后的单独句点条目；限制普通用户对系统目录的写入权限；应用程序中始终使用绝对路径调用系统命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=87602726319426&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=87602726319435&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/526","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1217.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1217","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1217.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1217.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6g8j-rqjx-jr9f/GHSA-6g8j-rqjx-jr9f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86275/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1217.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1317","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1068","title":"Oracle HTTP Server 2.1 PL/SQL 存储过程远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle WebServer 2.1 在处理 PL/SQL 存储过程时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送超长 HTTP GET 请求，触发服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Oracle HTTP Server 2.1 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1068"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:39Z","remediation":"升级到 Oracle HTTP Server（Oracle Webserver 的后续产品）或迁移至受支持的 Oracle WebLogic Server。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面限制 HTTP GET 请求 URI 长度不超过 2048 字节，并过滤包含超长查询参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602661419366&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1068","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1068.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1068.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g6wg-27vg-grv9/GHSA-g6wg-27vg-grv9.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1068.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/ows_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1068.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000194.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1317.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1224","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0971","title":"Exim Buffer 1.6.2/1.6.51 缓冲区溢出（本地权限提升）漏洞","description":"Exim 邮件服务器 1.6.2 和 1.6.51 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 .forward 文件中构造过长的 :include: 选项触发溢出，从而提升权限至 root。该漏洞影响 Exim 特定版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，属高危本地提权漏洞，攻击需具备本地账户访问权限，利用方式为精心构造恶意 .forward 文件触发栈溢出执行任意代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0971"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-07-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:26Z","remediation":"升级 Exim 至 2.0.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 :include: 选项的缓冲区边界检查。如无法升级，在 /etc/exim/exim.conf 中禁用 .forward 文件处理（设置 allow_forward = false），并限制本地用户对 .forward 文件的写入权限（chmod 644）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7301","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20333","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0971.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0971","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0971.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/76af88afbb282d6c9e8ce3b9f6942bcb7e39be57/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0971.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qxcj-688p-v8g5/GHSA-qxcj-688p-v8g5.json","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.1/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--8e403d18-af4e-4abd-bd38-0f99f74b4636.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0971.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000193.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1256","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1208","title":"IBM AIX ping 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.2 及更早版本中的 ping 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 ping 命令传递超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，攻击者可通过精心构造的输入参数实现权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1208"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"升级到当前支持的最低 IBM AIX 版本（建议 AIX 7.1 或更高），并应用最新的安全补丁包；立即修改 /etc/ping 配置文件，限制 ping 命令行参数长度至 1024 字节以下，并使用系统权限管理的漏洞扫描工具定期检测是否存在未修复的缓冲区溢出；如无法立即升级，可临时通过限制用户权限、禁用 ping 命令或在防火墙层面限制 ICMP 流量作为缓解措施","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602661419330&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602661419337&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/803","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19307","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1208.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1208","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1208.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1208.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h664-4mr2-whv6/GHSA-h664-4mr2-whv6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/387/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1208.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0feafa0f-ee74-450f-a0f6-2a3d06fac48b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0432","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0247","title":"INN nnrpd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"INN (InterNetNews) 新闻服务器中的 nnrpd 程序存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，版本 1.6 及之前版本受影响。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的新闻组请求，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器上以 nnrpd 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 INN 新闻服务器系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 INN 1.6 以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0247"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:59Z","remediation":"升级 INN 至 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞在 INN 1.7 及后续版本中已被修复。如无法升级，可在 innd 配置中限制 nnrpd 服务的远程访问来源 IP，或禁用 nnrpd 的远程连接功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.nai.com/nai_labs/asp_set/advisory/17_inn_avd.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1443","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0247.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0247.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0247","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0247.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0247.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0247.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-69m7-6fwc-hxpx/GHSA-69m7-6fwc-hxpx.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/inn.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0432.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0268","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0122","title":"IBM AIX lchangelv 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.2 系统中的 /usr/sbin/lchangelv 工具存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意代码。攻击者需要通过本地账户登录系统，向 lchangelv 程序提交特制的超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址或函数指针劫持进程控制流。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击前提是拥有本地 shell 访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0122"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:38Z","remediation":"IBM AIX 4.2 用户应立即升级至 AIX 4.3.3 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复；或安装对应 APAR 补丁包。临时缓解措施：以 root 权限执行 `chmod 500 /usr/sbin/lchangelv` 移除 setuid 位，限制普通用户执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0122","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19309","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0122","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0122.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0122.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0122.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccc7-4g5p-rggh/GHSA-ccc7-4g5p-rggh.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0122.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--772eac60-d912-4492-9f00-76b00cf63353.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1380","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1380.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1182","title":"Linux 动态链接器 ld.so/ld-linux.so 缓冲区溢出本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux 系统运行时链接器 ld.so 与 ld-linux.so 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过调用 setuid 程序并传递超长程序名（argv[0]）触发链接器报错处理逻辑中的缓冲区溢出，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响包括 openlinux_lite 在内的多个 Linux 发行版，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并能执行 setuid 程序，通过精心构造超长程序名参数触发链接器错误处理路径中的缓冲区溢出实现提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1182"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:53Z","remediation":"升级系统动态链接器 ld.so 和 ld-linux.so 到已修复版本，或应用 Alan Cox 提供的补丁，在 d-link/boot1.c 中增加 argv_remap 函数限制 argv[0] 长度不超过 256 字符，防止超长程序名通过 vsprintf 触发缓冲区溢出。已安装系统可通过发行版官方软件包管理器升级相关软件包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602661419318&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602661419351&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88661732807795&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad13a04165adf44a190b93c89d746f49525e5595/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1182.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0092","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0030","title":"SGI IRIX xlock 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 系统及其他类 Unix 操作系统（包括 BSD/OS、DG/UX、Debian、HP-UX、IBM AIX、Solaris）中 xlock 屏幕锁定程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 xlock 发送特制输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响广泛的多款 Unix 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0030"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:23Z","remediation":"SGI IRIX 系统应立即升级 xlock 程序至厂商已修复版本（如 IRIX 6.4 对应安全补丁），其他受影响系统（BSD/OS 2.1、Debian 1.3、HP-UX 10.34、IBM AIX 4.2、Solaris 2.5.1 等）应从各自厂商获取 xlock 安全更新。若无法立即打补丁，作为临时缓解措施可移除 xlock 的 setuid root 权限位（执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/xlock），限制本地用户以提权方式运行 xlock 程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0030"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0091","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0028","title":"SGI IRIX login/scheme 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 系统的 login/scheme 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过向存在缺陷的命令提交超长输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响多个 SGI IRIX 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0028"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:23Z","remediation":"SGI IRIX 5.3/6.2/6.3/6.4/6.5 均受影响，应立即安装 SGI 对应版本的安全补丁（如 IRIX 6.5 安装 Patch 3180 或更新版本）。若无法立即打补丁，可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/scheme` 移除 scheme 命令的 setuid 位，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0028"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0089","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0029","title":"SGI IRIX ordist 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 5.3 及 6.2 系统中的 ordist 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可向 ordist 命令提交特制请求触发缓冲区越界读取，从而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 5.3 和 6.2 版本，利用前提是攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，属于本地权限提升漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0029"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:23Z","remediation":"安装 SGI 于 1997 年发布的 ordist 安全补丁（SGI Security Advisory 19970701），或升级到 IRIX 6.3 及以上版本。如无法升级，建议移除 ordist 的 setuid root 权限：chmod u-s /usr/sbin/ordist，并限制仅授信用户可本地登录系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0029","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0029","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f47735aa52980ccd9473eed79b62a27c199a2cfa/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0029.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0029.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0029.md","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/nvd/CVE-1999-0029_0f0c3530-7572-4860-a943-991d78115c24","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-65pf-462r-g52c/GHSA-65pf-462r-g52c.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0029.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0089.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0089.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0083","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0027","title":"SGI IRIX eject 命令缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统的 eject 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该命令提交特制参数触发溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 及之前版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0027"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.3 及以上版本，或安装 SGI 官方提供的 eject 补丁。若无法升级，建议移除 eject 命令的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/eject），限制本地普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0027","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19277","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0027.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0027","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0027.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0027.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0027.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0027.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","ht